@* KNote Local: the computer's settings (api/local) — its repositories, the AI providers of the assistant, the e-mail
   account of the Email alarms and the local server (port, data folder, stop). A tab of the admin panel, only there when
   the server is KNote Local (Admin.razor, the server's capabilities). Each section reads and saves its own part. *@

@attribute [Authorize(Roles = "Admin")]

<KntIndexHeader Section="KntSections.ThisComputer" Subtitle="Settings of KNote Local in this computer" />

<div class="rz-pt-2 knt-local-settings">
    <LocalRepositories />
    <LocalAiProviders />
    <LocalEmailSettings />
    <LocalServerSettings />
</div>
